rce_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\tau^I\">\\((W_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\tau^I\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{i\\in I}W_i=X\">\\(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}W_i=X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i\">\\(F_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_i,\\tau|_{W_i})\">\\((W_i,\\tau|_{W_i})\\)</span> 上的层。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in I\">\\(i,j\\in I\\)</span> 给定自然同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{ij}:F_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\\to F_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\">\\(\\theta_{ij}:F_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\\to F_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\\)</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ii}=\\mathrm{id}_{F_i})\">\\(\\forall i\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ii}=\\mathrm{id}_{F_i})\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\ ((\\theta_{jk}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\\circ(\\theta_{ij}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})=\\theta_{ik}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\">\\(\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\ ((\\theta_{jk}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\\circ(\\theta_{ij}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})=\\theta_{ik}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\\)</span>。限制、自然变换使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 的签名。另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i:H|_{W_i}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_i\">\\(\\psi_i:H|_{W_i}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_i\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ij}\\circ(\\psi_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j})=\\psi_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j})\">\\(\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ij}\\circ(\\psi_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j})=\\psi_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j})\\)</span>。以下对象公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>，限制公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_{i,V}\">\\(\\phi_{i,V}\\)</span> 的参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\tau\">\\(V\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq W_i\">\\(V\\subseteq W_i\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(U)=\\left\\{(s_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}F_i(U\\cap W_i):\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\theta_{ij,U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j}(s_i|_{U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j})=s_j|_{U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(U)=\\left\\{(s_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}F_i(U\\cap W_i):\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\theta_{ij,U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j}(s_i|_{U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j})=s_j|_{U\\cap W_i\\cap W_j}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_{F,V}((s_i)_i)=(s_i|_{V\\cap W_i})_i\\quad(V\\subseteq U),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^U_{F,V}((s_i)_i)=(s_i|_{V\\cap W_i})_i\\quad(V\\subseteq U),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi_{i,V}:F(V)\\longrightarrow F_i(V),\\quad(s_j)_j\\longmapsto s_i\\quad(V\\subseteq W_i),\\qquad\\phi_i:F|_{W_i}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi_{i,V}:F(V)\\longrightarrow F_i(V),\\quad(s_j)_j\\longmapsto s_i\\quad(V\\subseteq W_i),\\qquad\\phi_i:F|_{W_i}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(H,F)\\;(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\phi_i\\alpha|_{W_i}=\\psi_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(H,F)\\;(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\phi_i\\alpha|_{W_i}=\\psi_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：兼容元组在每个分量中沿开覆盖唯一拼接，且过渡等式由局部成立推出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是层。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq W_i\">\\(V\\subseteq W_i\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\">\\(s_i\\)</span> 在各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cap W_j\">\\(V\\cap W_j\\)</span> 上经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{ij}\">\\(\\theta_{ij}\\)</span> 输送得到唯一元组，证明投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_i\">\\(\\phi_i\\)</span> 双射。比较态射按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i\">\\(\\psi_i\\)</span> 逐分量定义；余循环保证相容。唯一性由投影决定，且比较态射自动为同构。这同时写出原书正文严格相等版本和练习的同构下降版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$I\\in\\mathcal U$、$(W_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\tau^I$ 且 $\\bigcup_{i\\in I}W_i=X$，$F_i$ 是 $(W_i,\\tau|_{W_i})$ 上的层。对每个 $i,j\\in I$ 给定自然同构 $\\theta_{ij}:F_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\\to F_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j}$，并假设 $\\forall i\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ii}=\\mathrm{id}_{F_i})$ 及 $\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\ ((\\theta_{jk}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\\circ(\\theta_{ij}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})=\\theta_{ik}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})$。限制、自然变换使用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]、[[14-thm-shea